("Slope Coefficient", "斜率係數", "X 變一單位時 Y 的預期變化 b1。", "敏感度。", "\"The slope coefficient on duration approximates interest-rate sensitivity.\""),
("Residual", "殘差", "實際 Y 與預測 Y 的差。", "模型診斷。", "\"Large residuals in 2020 suggest the model missed the crisis regime.\""),
("ANOVA", "變異數分析", "分解總變異並檢定迴歸整體是否顯著。", "模型 F 檢定。", "\"ANOVA shows whether the regression explains a significant share of variance.\""),
("R-squared", "決定係數", "應變數變異中被模型解釋的比例。", "擬合優度。", "\"An R-squared of 0.35 means factors explain 35% of return variance.\""),
("Adjusted R-squared", "調整後決定係數", "對自變數個數調整後的 R²，避免過度擬合表象。", "模型比較。", "\"Prefer adjusted R-squared when comparing models with different factor counts.\""),
("Standard Error of Estimate", "估計標準誤", "殘差離散程度，衡量預測精確度。", "預測區間。", "\"A lower standard error of estimate means tighter prediction intervals.\""),
("Homoskedasticity", "同方差", "殘差變異數固定的假設。", "OLS 假設。", "\"Homoskedasticity fails when residual variance grows with firm size.\""),
("Heteroskedasticity", "異方差", "殘差變異數非常數。", "穩健標準誤。", "\"Heteroskedasticity can bias standard errors and t-statistics.\""),
("Autocorrelation", "自我相關", "殘差與自身落後期相關。", "時間序列。", "\"Autocorrelation in residuals violates classical regression assumptions.\""),
("Multicollinearity", "多重共線性", "自變數彼此高度相關，使係數不穩定。", "因子選擇。", "\"Multicollinearity between value factors inflates coefficient standard errors.\""),
("Dummy Variable", "虛擬變數", "取 0/1 以表示類別效應的變數。", "產業、危機期。", "\"Add a crisis dummy variable to capture the 2008 regime shift.\""),
("Log-Lin Model", "對數－線性模型", "應變數取對數、自變數為水準的模型，斜率近似半彈性。", "成長解釋。", "\"In a log-lin model, the slope is an approximate percentage change in Y.\""),
("Lin-Log Model", "線性－對數模型", "自變數取對數的模型。", "報酬遞減。", "\"A lin-log model fits when Y changes with proportional shifts in X.\""),
("Log-Log Model", "雙對數模型", "兩邊取對數，斜率為彈性。", "需求彈性。", "\"The log-log model estimates elasticity of demand directly.\""),
("Time Series", "時間序列", "依時間順序觀測的資料序列。", "報酬、通膨。", "\"Monthly returns form a time series we can test for momentum.\""),
("Trend", "趨勢", "時間序列長期上升或下降的成分。", "宏觀序列。", "\"GDP shows an upward trend over decades.\""),
("Seasonality", "季節性", "在固定週期重複出現的型態。", "零售銷售。", "\"Retail sales show strong seasonality around the holidays.\""),
("Covariance Stationary", "共變異數平穩", "平均、變異數與自我共變不隨時間變，僅依落後期。", "AR 模型前提。", "\"Many forecasting models require a covariance-stationary series.\""),
("Autoregressive Model", "自我迴歸模型", "以自身落後期預測現值的模型，如 AR(1)。", "報酬預測。", "\"An AR(1) autoregressive model uses last month's return to forecast this month.\""),
("Mean Reversion", "均值回歸", "變數傾向回到長期平均水準的性質。", "評價偏離。", "\"If spreads show mean reversion, wide levels may attract buyers.\""),
("Random Walk", "隨機漫步", "今日值＝昨日值＋不可預測衝擊；差分後常較平穩。", "價格可預測性。", "\"If prices follow a random walk, past prices don't forecast future changes.\""),
("Unit Root", "單根", "使序列非平穩的特徵根；常以檢定偵測。", "差分決策。", "\"A unit root in yields suggests we should model changes, not levels.\""),
("Machine Learning", "機器學習", "讓演算法從資料學習模式以預測或分類的方法集合。", "另類資料、訊號。", "\"Machine learning can uncover nonlinear patterns traditional models miss.\""),
("Supervised Learning", "監督式學習", "用已知標籤的資料訓練模型以預測新資料。", "違約預測。", "\"Default prediction is a supervised learning problem with labeled outcomes.\""),
("Unsupervised Learning", "非監督式學習", "在無標籤下尋找結構，如分群。", "客戶分群。", "\"Unsupervised learning clusters clients by behavior without predefined labels.\""),
("Deep Learning", "深度學習", "使用多層神經網路的機器學習方法。", "影像、複雜型態。", "\"Deep learning may help parse satellite images for retail traffic signals.\""),
("Overfitting", "過度配適", "模型擬合噪音導致樣本外表現差。", "複雜模型。", "\"Too many factors cause overfitting and weak live performance.\""),
("Cross-Validation", "交叉驗證", "反覆分割訓練／驗證集以評估樣本外表現。", "模型選擇。", "\"Use cross-validation to tune hyperparameters without peeking at the test set.\""),
("Training Sample", "訓練樣本", "用來估計模型參數的資料集。", "模型建置。", "\"Fit the model on the training sample from 2000 to 2015.\""),
("Validation Sample", "驗證樣本", "用於調參、防止過度配適的樣本。", "超參數。", "\"Choose the penalty strength with the validation sample.\""),
