("Bias-Variance Tradeoff", "偏差－變異權衡", "模型過簡偏差大、過複變異大，須平衡。", "複雜度選擇。", "\"The bias-variance tradeoff guides how flexible our signal model should be.\""),
("Penalized Regression", "懲罰迴歸", "如 LASSO／Ridge，對係數加罰以降低過度配適。", "多因子篩選。", "\"LASSO is a penalized regression that can shrink weak factors to zero.\""),
("Classification", "分類", "預測類別標籤的監督式任務。", "漲跌、違約。", "\"Bankruptcy prediction is a classification task, not a regression for price.\""),
